    <string name="voidhack_aq_info_title">About this signal path</string>
    <string name="voidhack_aq_info_usb_direct">Userspace USB Direct Driver (UAC %1$d.0) is active. Unmodified integer PCM from Apple Music\'s decoder is streamed directly to your USB DAC over Linux usbdevfs isochronous transfers, bypassing AudioTrack, AudioFlinger, Sound Check scaling, and the vendor USB HAL. Volume changes adjust the DAC\'s hardware Feature Unit without modifying PCM samples.</string>
    <string name="voidhack_aq_info_bit_perfect">Android 14+ USB Exclusive Bit-Perfect (MIXER_BEHAVIOR_BIT_PERFECT) is active. Integer PCM is delivered directly to your USB DAC, bypassing AudioFlinger mixing, resampling, and OS software volume scaling.</string>
    <string name="voidhack_aq_info_resampled">Android\'s standard audio mixer resamples streams to %1$s. To play Hi-Res Lossless above 48 kHz natively, connect an external USB DAC supported by high-resolution or bit-perfect output.</string>
    <string name="voidhack_aq_info_bluetooth">Over Bluetooth A2DP, decoded PCM audio is encoded by the active Bluetooth codec (such as LDAC, aptX, AAC, or SBC) for wireless transmission. Even hi-res codecs like LDAC (up to 990 kbps) apply lossy compression compared to full ALAC PCM.</string>
    <string name="voidhack_aq_info_bluetooth_pending">Over Bluetooth A2DP, decoded PCM audio is encoded by the active Bluetooth codec (such as LDAC, aptX, AAC, or SBC). Because Android restricts direct getCodecStatus() queries to system apps, the codec name updates automatically the next time your headset connects or changes sample rate/codec while Apple Music is running.</string>
    <string name="voidhack_aq_info_lossless">Your current signal path preserves the source sample rate and lossless resolution all the way to the connected output device.</string>
    <string name="voidhack_aq_info_atmos">Dolby Atmos encodes three-dimensional spatial metadata over E-AC-3 JOC. Playback renders spatial cues via your device\'s Dolby decoder or passes the bitstream over HDMI.</string>
    <string name="voidhack_aq_info_general">Displays the active audio format from Apple Music\'s playback engine, Android\'s AudioTrack / mixer pipeline, and the currently routed output hardware in real time.</string>
